# Public commit hygiene (motif-proto)

This repository is (or will be) public-facing. For every git commit and PR:

- Do **not** add `Co-authored-by`, `Made-with`, or any Cursor / AI attribution trailers.
- Do **not** put work or personal emails (`@ambr.net`, Gmail, etc.) in author, committer, or message body.
- Author and committer must use a GitHub `users.noreply.github.com` identity only (configure with `git config --local user.email`).
- Do **not** link private or internal systems: no `gitlab.com/ambr1/...`, no internal Notion, no VPN-only URLs.
- Do **not** put private ticket IDs or links in commit messages or PR descriptions.
- Keep commit messages to a short subject plus optional technical rationale; no ticket footers.
